@HostAddress = http://localhost:5217

### 1. Crear Perfil del Cliente
# @name createCustomer
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Pérez",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "gender": 1,
  "monthlyIncome": 3500.00
}

### 2. Consultar Cliente por Id
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.id}}
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}

### 3. Listar Todos los Clientes
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers

### 4. Crear Cuenta Bancaria (Algoritmo ACC-YYYYMMDD-[XXXX])
# @name createAccount
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "initialBalance": 500.00
}

### 5. Consultar Saldo Actual
@accountNumber = {{createAccount.response.body.accountNumber}}
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts/{{accountNumber}}/balance

### 6. Listar Todas las Cuentas Bancarias
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts

### 7. Registrar un Depósito (Incrementa saldo)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts/{{accountNumber}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250.00
}

### 7. Registrar un Retiro Exitoso (Decrementa saldo)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts/{{accountNumber}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.00
}

### 8. Intentar un Retiro Sin Fondos (Rechazo limpio con HTTP 400 y mensaje en español)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts/{{accountNumber}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 9999.00
}

### 9. Consultar Historial de Transacciones (Orden cronológico y saldo histórico)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/bank-accounts/{{accountNumber}}/transactions
